{"strongs": "H0185", "word": "אַוָּה", "translit": "av.vah", "root": "אוה", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "desire", "definition": "[ אַוָּה ] noun feminine desire — construct אַוַּת Deut 12:15 + 5 t.; suffix אַוָּתִי Hos 10:10 — desire, will , usually followed by נֶפֶשׁ ; of natural human desire (morally indifferent), for meat Deut 12:15 ; Deut 12:20 ; Deut 12:21 of longing for sanctuary Deut 18:6 of royal good pleasure 1Sam 23:20 without נֶפֶשׁ , of wild-ass Jer 2:24 of divine will Hos 10:10 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB178')\">BDB178</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H185')\">H185</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB177')\">BDB177</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB179')\">BDB179</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>אַוָּה</bdbheb>] <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>desire</highlightword> — construct <bdbheb>אַוַּת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 12:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,12,15)\">Deut 12:15</ref> + 5 t.; suffix <bdbheb>אַוָּתִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 10:10\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(28,10,10)\">Hos 10:10</ref> — <highlight>desire, will</highlight>, usually followed by <bdbheb>נֶפֶשׁ</bdbheb>; of natural human desire (morally indifferent), for meat <ref ref=\"Deut 12:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,12,15)\">Deut 12:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 12:20\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(5,12,20)\">Deut 12:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 12:21\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(5,12,21)\">Deut 12:21</ref> of longing for sanctuary <ref ref=\"Deut 18:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,18,6)\">Deut 18:6</ref> of royal good pleasure <ref ref=\"1Sam 23:20\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bc